    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDiscover modern living in the heart of Dublin's vibrant Docklands at The Benson, Britain Quay, Dublin 2. These beautifully designed 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments combine elegant interiors, high-spec finishes, and stunning city views.\n\nParking 75 per month if required.\n\nApartment Highlights:\n• Spacious, light-filled interiors with floor-to-ceiling glazing\n• Graphite matt kitchens with premium Miele appliances\n• Stylish bathrooms with rainfall showers and contemporary finishes\n• Private balconies or terraces for outdoor living\n• Utility rooms with washer/dryer and ample storage\n• A-rated energy efficiency with heat recovery ventilation\n\nExclusive Resident Amenities:\n• Concierge service & parcel collection\n• Business centre and co-working spaces\n• Rooftop sun terrace with panoramic views\n• Secure basement parking & bicycle storage\n• Pet-friendly community\nLocation Perks:\n• Situated in Dublin's Docklands, steps from tech and financial hubs\n• Short walk to Grand Canal Dock, theatres, cafés, and restaurants\n• Excellent transport links: Luas, DART, and bus routes nearby"
      },
